@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Check-in roster
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/check-ins
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Check-in roster filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/check-ins?checkedIn=true&retreatGroupId={{retreatGroupId}}&keyword=Grace
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Check-in detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/check-ins/{{participantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Manual check-in
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/check-ins/{{participantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Cancel check-in
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/check-ins/{{participantId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Checked in under a duplicate registration."
}

### Issue QR check-in token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/check-ins/tokens/{{participantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expiresAt": "2026-07-01T23:59:59Z"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("checkInToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### Revoke QR check-in token
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/check-ins/tokens/{{participantId}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
